      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "If you are planing to visit Longleat this year and shop at Tesco's have you thought about using your club card vouchers to pay for the visit ?\nJust £6.50 in vouchers will get you a Longleat passport ticket worth £23.\nWe do this every year as we live very close and save a fortune\nEnjoy 11 amazing attractions at one superb price! The Passport Ticket saves you almost 50% off the combined individual attractions' admission prices PLUS, you don't need to complete it in one visit! Split your visit over a weekend or even over several... each attraction can be visited once only but you can come back at any time before the end of the season (1 November 2009) to see those attractions previously missed! It's by far, the best value ticket!\n😀",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8752/#81801",
